# Generated runtime evidence and pids stay out of git so the strict launcher's
# clean-tree gate keeps passing across supervisor restarts. Only the harness and
# the human-written run verdicts are tracked. A dirty tree makes every automatic
# restart fail closed.
snapshots/
manifest.json
incidents.log
*.log
*.pid
*.out
*.jsonl
*.json
# Preserved evidence from invalidated runs: keep the written verdict, ignore the raw
# artefacts it describes.
invalidated_run_*/**
!invalidated_run_*/INVALID.md
